<div class="section-heading">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Server-loaded modal</p>
    <h2>Dialog content as a fragment</h2>
  </div>
  <p>The backdrop and dialog arrive from Express; the close action swaps the modal container back to empty.</p>
</div>

<button class="button button-primary" type="button" hx-get="/api/modal/details" hx-target="#modal-container" hx-swap="innerHTML transition:true">
  Open modal
</button>

<details class="code-panel">
  <summary>Modal trigger</summary>
  <pre><code>&lt;button hx-get="/api/modal/details"
        hx-target="#modal-container"
        hx-swap="innerHTML transition:true"&gt;</code></pre>
</details>
